:COND NAME=NOTCHG EXPR='&CANCHG. NE "Y"'.
.* The menus.
:PANEL NAME=WRKJOB KEYL=WJKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Job
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 101'.Display job status attributes
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 102'.Display job definition attributes
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='RETURN 103'.Display job run attributes, if active
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='RETURN 104'.Work with spooled files
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='RETURN 110'.Display job log, if active, on job queue, or pending
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='RETURN 111'.Display call stack, if active
:MENUI OPTION=12 ACTION='RETURN 112'.Work with locks, if active
:MENUI OPTION=13 ACTION='RETURN 113'.Display library list, if active
:MENUI OPTION=14 ACTION='RETURN 114'.Display open files, if active
:MENUI OPTION=15 ACTION='RETURN 115'.Display file overrides, if active
:MENUI OPTION=16 ACTION='RETURN 116'.Display commitment control status, if active
:MENUI OPTION=17 ACTION='RETURN 117'.Display communications status, if active
:MENUI OPTION=18 ACTION='RETURN 118'.Display activation groups, if active
:MENUI OPTION=19 ACTION='RETURN 119'.Display mutexes, if active
:MENUI OPTION=20 ACTION='RETURN 120'.Work with threads, if active
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPJOB KEYL=DJKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 101'.Display job status attributes
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 102'.Display job definition attributes
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='RETURN 103'.Display job run attributes, if active
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='RETURN 104'.Display spooled files
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='RETURN 110'.Display job log, if active, on job queue, or pending
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='RETURN 111'.Display call stack, if active
:MENUI OPTION=12 ACTION='RETURN 112'.Display locks, if active
:MENUI OPTION=13 ACTION='RETURN 113'.Display library list, if active
:MENUI OPTION=14 ACTION='RETURN 114'.Display open files, if active
:MENUI OPTION=15 ACTION='RETURN 115'.Display file overrides, if active
:MENUI OPTION=16 ACTION='RETURN 116'.Display commitment control status, if active
:MENUI OPTION=17 ACTION='RETURN 117'.Display communications status, if active
:MENUI OPTION=18 ACTION='RETURN 118'.Display activation groups, if active
:MENUI OPTION=19 ACTION='RETURN 119'.Display mutexes, if active
:MENUI OPTION=20 ACTION='RETURN 120'.Display threads, if active
:EMENU.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 1: status attributes.
:PANEL NAME=STSA KEYL=ATTRKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Status Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status of job
:DATAI VAR=CURUSER USAGE=OUTPUT.Current user profile
:DATAI VAR=IDENTITY USAGE=OUTPUT.Job user identity
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=SETBY USAGE=OUTPUT.Set by
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Entered system
:DATAI VAR=ENTDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Date
:DATAI VAR=ENTTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Time
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Started
:DATAI VAR=STRDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Date
:DATAI VAR=STRTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Time
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=SBSPOOL USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem pool ID
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type of job
:DATAI VAR=SPCENV USAGE=OUTPUT.Special environment
:DATAI VAR=RTNCODE USAGE=OUTPUT.Program return code
:DATAI VAR=CNTRLD USAGE=OUTPUT.Controlled end requested
:DATAI VAR=SYSPOOL USAGE=OUTPUT.System pool identifier
:DATAI VAR=CPUMS USAGE=OUTPUT.Processing unit time used, in ms
:DATAI VAR=AUXIO USAGE=OUTPUT.Auxiliary I/O requests of the job
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 2: definition attributes.
:PANEL NAME=DFNA KEYL=ATTRKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Definition Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI VAR=JOBD USAGE=OUTPUT.Job description
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=JOBDLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=JOBQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Job queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=JOBQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=JOBPTY USAGE=OUTPUT.Job priority (on job queue)
:DATAI VAR=OUTPTY USAGE=OUTPUT.Output priority (on output queue)
:DATAI VAR=ENDSEV USAGE=OUTPUT.End severity
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Message logging
:DATAI VAR=LOGLVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Level
:DATAI VAR=LOGSEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Severity
:DATAI VAR=LOGTXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=LOGCLPGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Log CL program commands
:DATAI VAR=LOGOUT USAGE=OUTPUT.Job log output
:DATAI VAR=PRTDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Printer device
:DATAI VAR=OUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Default output queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=OUTQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=PRTTXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Printer text
:DATAI VAR=DATFMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Date format
:DATAI VAR=DATSEP USAGE=OUTPUT.Date separator
:DATAI VAR=TIMSEP USAGE=OUTPUT.Time separator
:DATAI VAR=DECFMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Decimal format
:DATAI VAR=SWS USAGE=OUTPUT.Job switches
:DATAI VAR=INQMSG USAGE=OUTPUT.Inquiry message reply
:DATAI VAR=BRKMSG USAGE=OUTPUT.Break message handling
:DATAI VAR=STSMSG USAGE=OUTPUT.Status message
:DATAI VAR=DEVRCY USAGE=OUTPUT.Device recovery action
:DATAI VAR=CCSID USAGE=OUTPUT.Coded character set identifier
:DATAI VAR=DFTCCSID USAGE=OUTPUT.Default coded character set identifier
:DATAI VAR=LANGID USAGE=OUTPUT.Language identifier
:DATAI VAR=CNTRYID USAGE=OUTPUT.Country or region identifier
:DATAI VAR=SRTSEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Sort sequence
:DATAI VAR=MSGQMX USAGE=OUTPUT.Job message queue maximum size
:DATAI VAR=MSGQFL USAGE=OUTPUT.Job message queue full action
:DATAI VAR=ALWMLT USAGE=OUTPUT.Allow multiple threads
:DATAI VAR=SPLFACN USAGE=OUTPUT.Spooled file action
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 3: run attributes.
:PANEL NAME=RUNA KEYL=ATTRKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Run Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI VAR=RUNPTY USAGE=OUTPUT.Run priority
:DATAI VAR=TIMESLICE USAGE=OUTPUT.Time slice in milliseconds
:DATAI VAR=PURGE USAGE=OUTPUT.Eligible for purge
:DATAI VAR=DFTWAIT USAGE=OUTPUT.Default wait time in seconds
:DATAI VAR=CPUTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum CPU time in milliseconds
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=CPUUSED USAGE=OUTPUT.CPU time used
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=MAXTMP USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum temporary storage in megabytes
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=TMPUSED USAGE=OUTPUT.Temporary storage used
:DATAI VAR=TMPPEAK USAGE=OUTPUT.Peak temporary storage used
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=MAXTHD USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum threads
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=THREADS USAGE=OUTPUT.Threads
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Thread resources affinity
:DATAI VAR=AFFGRP USAGE=OUTPUT.Group
:DATAI VAR=AFFLVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Level
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=RSCAFF USAGE=OUTPUT.Resources affinity group
.* Not shown: it sets the colon column.
:DATAI VAR=CPUTHD USAGE=OUTPUT DISPLAY=NO.Maximum processing unit time per thread
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 4: the job's spooled files.
:PANEL NAME=SPLF KEYL=SPLFKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1'.Work with Job Spooled Files
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=SPLF.(No spooled output files)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?SNDNETSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.1=Send
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGSPLFA FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD HLDSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.3=Hold
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD RLSSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.6=Release
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 7'.7=Messages
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKSPLFA FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.8=Attributes
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 9'.9=Work with printing status
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Device or Queue
:LISTCOL VAR=USRDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.User Data
:LISTCOL VAR=SPLSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=PAGES USAGE=OUTPUT.Total Pages
:LISTCOL VAR=CURPAGE USAGE=OUTPUT.Current Page
:LISTCOL VAR=COPIES USAGE=OUTPUT.Copies
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters for options 1, 2, 3 or command
:EPANEL.
.* Option 10 and DSPJOBLOG: the job log.
:PANEL NAME=JOBLOG KEYL=LOGKEYS HELP=JOBLOG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Log
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.&JOBHDR.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=MSGS.
:LISTCOL VAR=MSGLINE USAGE=OUTPUT.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=JOBLOGALL KEYL=ALLKEYS HELP=JOBLOG ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display All Messages
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.&JOBHDR.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=MSGS.
:LISTCOL VAR=MSGLINE USAGE=OUTPUT.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 11: the call stack.
:PANEL NAME=CALLSTK KEYL=STKKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display Call Stack
:DATA DEPTH=3 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:DATAI VAR=THREAD USAGE=OUTPUT.Thread
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=STACK MAXHEAD=2.
:LISTCOL VAR=RQSLVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Program
:LISTCOL VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.
:LISTCOL VAR=STMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Statement
:LISTCOL VAR=PROC USAGE=OUTPUT.Procedure
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 13: the library list.
:PANEL NAME=LIBL KEYL=LIBLKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display Library List
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAIX VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.User
:DATAIX VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Number
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LIBL.
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPLIB LIB(&LIB.)'.5=Display objects in library
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=LIBTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTGRP.ASP
:LISTCOL VAR=ASPDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL VAR=LIBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 14: the open files.
:PANEL NAME=OPNF KEYL=OPNFKEYS HELP=WRKJOB ENTER='RETURN 1'.Display Open Files
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATAC.&JOBHDR.
:DATAI VAR=ODPS USAGE=OUTPUT.Number of open data paths
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OPNF.
:LISTCOL VAR=OFILE USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:LISTCOL VAR=OLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=OMBR USAGE=OUTPUT.Member/ Device
:LISTCOL VAR=OSCOPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Scope
:LISTCOL VAR=OACTGRP USAGE=OUTPUT.Activation Group
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKJOB.Job - Help
:P.One job: who it is, how it was defined and how it runs, its
spooled files, its job log, its call stack, its library list and the
files it has open. Type an option number and press Enter.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=JOBLOG.Job log - Help
:P.The messages the job has logged, oldest first. A request typed at
a command line shows with the marks before it. F10 shows every
message, the detailed ones included.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
